  "details": "I would like VRChat to add a functionality to limit player placing portal in world.\n\nAs a world creator I do not want player to place portal in certain area of the map, but allowing in other area or a specific area. Or even prevent more than certain number of portals can be dropped in world within a limited time.\n\nThere's a workaround performed by this world but I could not get contact with the creator. Hopefully VRChat could consider adding it as a feature.\n\nhttps://vrchat.com/home/world/wrld_f20326da-f1ac-45fc-a062-609723b097b1",
